Source: https://www.acma.gov.au/list-transmitters-licence-broadcast
Attribution: Australian Communications and Media Authority (ACMA). The raw workbook
is not committed. Only the AM, FM and DR rows were converted by
tools/acma_to_stations.py into stations.csv (see README.md for the filter rules).

This is a station finder, not a licence register. ACMA says a transmitter entry
shows a licence exists, not that the service is operating as recorded.
